   "text": "Frontier Tech - Convergence & Biological Capital: October 17, 2026\n\n\n\ud83e\uddec The Binding Physical Constraints on Artificial Intelligence and Biological Longevity.\n\n\nThe technology sector is experiencing a violent hyper-divergence where the unit cost of digital intelligence is collapsing, yet the physical infrastructure required to generate it faces severe capital bottlenecks. While artificial intelligence inference costs plummet by up to 99.99% annually, driving enterprise software token spend growth to zero, hyperscaler electricity demand is triggering aggressive regulatory crackdowns. Physical resource constraints have superseded algorithmic design, highlighted by Finland halting $15 billion in ",
